# Ask the mode manager to change mode. Served on /change_state.
# The call returns when the change has finished or failed.
# Asked for while another change is in progress, idle and failsafe (the requests that stop the
# robot) wait for it to finish, up to 120 s, and are then applied. Any other request is refused
# as busy.
string new_state
---
bool success
string message      # what happened, or why the request was refused
